<title>EGYPT: Egyptian overnight rates, one-week rates fall.</title>
<headline>Egyptian overnight rates, one-week rates fall.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound fell in a liquid private sector market on Thursday to between 9 3/4 and 10 1/16 percent from Wednesday's range of 10 1/8 and 10 3/16 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates fell to between 10 3/16 and 10 1/4 from 10 1/4 and 10 1/2 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Public-sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
